-- Sales & Marketing Insight Assistant — synthetic seed data
--
-- 160 rows: 20 campaigns x 8 months (Jan-Aug 2025), covering all 4 regions,
-- all 6 channels, and all 4 campaign types from the schema. Numbers are
-- internally consistent (cac = spend/conversions, roas = sales_revenue/spend)
-- and North is deliberately the strongest-performing region so example
-- questions like "leads by region" and "which campaign performed best"
-- produce clear, non-degenerate answers.
--
-- Run this AFTER schema.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor.
-- If you have the original TalentSprint-provided Sales_Marketing_Data.csv,
-- use Supabase's table CSV importer instead and skip this file.

ON CONFLICT (campaign_id) DO NOTHING;
